"Ticket Sales","Food","Juice Bars & Smoothies","Health Markets","Professional Sports Teams","Specialty Food","Stadiums & Arenas"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"f-WhNOSwN1aB4nRFekf01g","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":1045,"mm_rank":1114,"target_category_support_fraction":0.125,"selected_image_count":3,"label_diversity":3,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Arts & Entertainment","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Ticket Sales","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Juice Bars & Smoothies","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Health Markets","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Professional Sports Teams","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Specialty Food","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Stadiums & Arenas","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"f-WhNOSwN1aB4nRFekf01g","review_id":"1o8NsYmlqvqSYWK35GEtfw","date":"2017-01-20T02:54:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9389216303825378,"text_excerpt":"Went to a New Orleans Pelicans game and had a blast. The arena is clean, safe and has all the updated bells and whistles. They had a basketball hoop set up outside so kids could enjoy themselves. There were food trucks, a dj and other interactive activities for the entire family. The wall of jerseys and the Anthony Davis mural were nice. They had a lot of variety at the concession stand. I went to Zataran's and had jambalaya which was delicious and the portion sizes were great. The seats were great and the arena offers a guys night out package which included a ticket, 2 beverages (water,soda or beer) and a souvenir glass. Never got my glass but that's fine I was traveling so it would be a..."},{"business_id":"f-WhNOSwN1aB4nRFekf01g","review_id":"olZURGcX6rxg5rE9BAIeKA","date":"2015-01-01T19:24:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9376274943351746,"text_excerpt":"This arena is actually quite charming in its own little way. This place gives you a homely feeling more so than a lot of basketball venues in today's game. If you're in for a great atmosphere and wanting to have a good time, try watching the local Pelicans take on someone else in the nba. Sure, they are not the best team in the league, but they definitely put up a fight and their fans are extremely passionate about the game. Came into town, sat in the club levels, enjoyed some jambalaya and a cocktail while watching the game, can't beat that. Also, this may be one of the cheapest ticket prices venues in the entire nba, take a chance on stubhub, you may be surprised..."},{"business_id":"f-WhNOSwN1aB4nRFekf01g","review_id":"czoMCY2cqVBgb4Ua_Gcjmg","date":"2014-04-10T04:24:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9365026950836182,"text_excerpt":"I refuse to call this the Smoothie King whatever. Hehe...but seriously the New Orleans Arena is pretty darned awesome! Back when we were the Hornets I came to a few games and sat in the nosebleed section. But for my first game watching the Pelicans I had clubhouse seats! Let me tell y'all, the clubhouse is swanky! Just look at my pix and compare the regular ladies restroom to the one in the clubhouse. My friend Steve I always makes fun of the fact that I take pix of ladies restrooms but for me it's a big deal if it's clean. A dirty restroom doesn't bode well for the cleanliness of a joint for me. Besides, I have the tiniest bladder known to man so I'm always going to the bathroom so I wan..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"f-WhNOSwN1aB4nRFekf01g","photo_id":"A7e7RIvOy22o_7IYEmQbFw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/A7e7RIvOy22o_7IYEmQbFw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.83995521068573},{"business_id":"f-WhNOSwN1aB4nRFekf01g","photo_id":"1eyID08UO5izgy66XEqvag","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1eyID08UO5izgy66XEqvag.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7883741855621338},{"business_id":"f-WhNOSwN1aB4nRFekf01g","photo_id":"-u8SFiSkxe9d9YQumna5Eg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-u8SFiSkxe9d9YQumna5Eg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7607487440109253}]},"notebook_case":null}
